; Several workspaces pull in better-auth plugins (@better-auth/stripe,
; @polar-sh/better-auth, ...) whose peerDependency ranges on better-call /
; @better-auth/core don't all line up across the monorepo even when the
; direct version pins are correct — see the "better-call" root override in
; package.json. legacy-peer-deps keeps `npm install` from hard-failing on
; those peer mismatches instead of every contributor needing to remember
; the flag.
legacy-peer-deps=true
